# VARS: a check of Studio's 64 variables (make test-vars). Each has its
# own value: A is 1 and A1 5 (variable 8), H7 (63) is 7, B2 (17) is
# A1 + H7 = 12, C5 (42) counts to 10 in a loop. It shows 1 5 7 12 10.
MODE 1
BG 2

START STAGE
SET A 1
SET A1 5
SET H7 7
SET B2 A1
CHANGE B2 H7
SET C5 0
REPEAT 10
  CHANGE C5 1
END
PRINT A 100 100
PRINT A1 140 100
PRINT H7 180 100
PRINT B2 220 100
PRINT C5 260 100
